    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/flower-shop-elementor/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Flower Shop Theme is a stunning and versatile free ecommerce template tailored specifically for florist shops, floral designers, and flower stores, making it ideal for building an online flower delivery store, dropshipping floral products, POD floral gifts, and personalized bouquet merchandise. Perfect for showcasing bouquets, floral arrangements, and related products, this theme offers an elegant and user-friendly platform to create an engaging online presence with support for WooCommerce, enabling online ordering, secure checkout, product catalog management, and gift add-ons. Designed with the needs of the floral industry in mind, the Flower Shop Theme helps florists, floral shops, rosebud flower shops, and nursery or garden decor stores attract more customers and boost online sales with SEO-ready structure and compatibility with Yoast SEO for improved visibility. It includes professionally crafted templates for key pages to ensure your site looks polished and performs seamlessly across devices; the Shop Page is ideal for showcasing floral products such as bouquets, wedding bouquets, flowers and gifts, while the About Us Page lets you share your brand story, passion for flowers, and build trust with customers. Suitable for floral boutiques, flower delivery services, gift shops, nurseries, gardening shops, and event décor businesses, it offers customization options for colors, fonts, and layouts to match your brand identity. Whether selling fresh flowers, gifting products, or décor services, the theme delivers a flawless browsing experience on desktops and smartphones, while Contact Form 7 supports inquiry forms for custom orders, event bookings, or subscription-based floral services. The Flower Shop Theme is the perfect solution for creating a beautiful, sales-driven online presence that captivates visitors and enhances user engagement. Demo: https://preview.wpelemento.com/flower-shop-elementor/"
    },
